{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hardest part of working on this game was to stop playing it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fine control with high-speed flicks to get to your goal as fast as possible in this one-handed platformer game. Don't be afraid to fall, you have nothing to lose except your composure.<br><br>You play as an armadillo with a tiny set of paws and a mighty tail. Master it to climb, jump, and bounce your way back home through tricky levels designed to test your skill and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is for anyone who loves:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-handed gameplay</strong> with responsive, flick-based controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging platforming</strong> where every move can make or break your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist experience</strong> that's easy to pick up but difficult to put down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrunning potential</strong> with an integrated timer for chasing new personal bests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage-quit</strong> friendly save system.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694030?t=1767992298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694030/0fb5269288d80d63259c80926d66adf8c88c25cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767992298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694030/942ef54da359518f07450e395de428899f19032a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767992298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694030/942ef54da359518f07450e395de428899f19032a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767992298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3981560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hardest part of working on this game was to stop playing it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fine control with high-speed flicks to get to your goal as fast as possible in this one-handed platformer game. Don't be afraid to fall, you have nothing to lose except your composure.<br><br>You play as an armadillo with a tiny set of paws and a mighty tail. Master it to climb, jump, and bounce your way back home through tricky levels designed to test your skill and patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is for anyone who loves:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-handed gameplay</strong> with responsive, flick-based controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging platforming</strong> where every move can make or break your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist experience</strong> that's easy to pick up but difficult to put down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrunning potential</strong> with an integrated timer for chasing new personal bests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage-quit</strong> friendly save system.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Screaming Armadillo"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694030/a870bcece22d7ae615ae025615ae3a58137e73b4/header.jpg?t=1767992298","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3694030/2132183068/85756265bb0d93898bacaa94b559a44b0d173676/1760225664/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760226361","dash_h